    {"id":"upper-ch08-conditioning-projection","volume":"upper","chapter":"ch08","kind":"evidence","scene":"conditioning","caption":"条件期望是对可见信息的最佳平方误差投影；残差在该信息空间方向上正交。","file":"tex/upper/chapters/ch08.tex","anchor":"\\section{$L^2$ 投影、条件 Jensen 与全方差}"},
    {"id":"upper-ch10-multiple-testing","volume":"upper","chapter":"ch10","kind":"evidence","scene":"multiple-testing","caption":"同时检验多个假设时，纯噪声也更容易产生极小 p 值；多重检验方法针对整个假设族控制错误。","file":"tex/upper/chapters/ch10.tex","anchor":"\\section{多重检验：先登记检验族，再看最小 p 值}"},
