    {"id":"lower-dv-replication","volume":"lower","chapter":"derivatives-stochastic","kind":"flow","nodes":["option payoff","delta stock","cash account","self-financing hedge","no-arbitrage price"],"roles":["object","object","background","valid","valid"],"caption":"股票与现金的动态组合匹配衍生品价值变化；自融资复制关系给出无套利价格。","file":"tex/lower/chapters/derivatives-stochastic.tex","anchor":"\\section{无套利、复制与风险中性测度}"},
