    {"id":"lower-dv-pde","volume":"lower","chapter":"derivatives-numerics","kind":"evidence","scene":"pde-grid","caption":"有限差分从到期支付出发，沿剩余期限增加的方向求解价格；空间边界和时间步长共同影响数值近似。","file":"tex/lower/chapters/derivatives-numerics.tex","anchor":"\\section{有限差分：一致性、稳定性与边界}"},
