    {"id":"lower-pf-risk-map","volume":"lower","chapter":"portfolio-risk-estimation","kind":"evidence","scene":"risk-ellipse","caption":"协方差矩阵把权重方向映射为风险椭圆；主轴方向和长度分别对应特征向量与特征值。","file":"tex/lower/chapters/portfolio-risk-estimation.tex","anchor":"\\section{先确定收益矩阵的含义}"},
    {"id":"lower-pf-shrinkage","volume":"lower","chapter":"portfolio-risk-estimation","kind":"evidence","scene":"shrinkage","caption":"收缩在高方差样本协方差与结构化目标之间权衡，通常以少量偏差换取更低估计波动。","file":"tex/lower/chapters/portfolio-risk-estimation.tex","anchor":"\\section{收缩与因子风险模型}"},
    {"id":"lower-pf-frontier","volume":"lower","chapter":"portfolio-risk-optimization","kind":"evidence","scene":"frontier","caption":"增加约束或计入成本会缩小可达到的收益与风险组合；最优选择也随风险偏好与换手代价变化。","file":"tex/lower/chapters/portfolio-risk-optimization.tex","anchor":"\\section{观点后验、尾部目标与稳健实施}"},
